<section class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">BIYODEX / ABOUT</span><h1>Discover. Explore. <em>Protect.</em></h1><p>BiyoDex is an educational biodiversity index designed to make learning about Philippine species engaging, accessible, and grounded in credible information.</p></section><section class="intro"><h2>Starting with <em>medicinal plants.</em></h2><p>The first edition focuses on ten Philippine medicinal plants. Future versions may expand to other flora and fauna.</p></section>
